s, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["column1","column2","column3"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"map":{"type":"map","disabled":true,"settings":{"map_title":"Our retail store","address":"<p>301 Front St W<br>Toronto, Canada<\/p><p>Mon - Fri, 8:30am - 10:30pm<br>Saturday, 8:30am - 10:30pm<br>Sunday, 8:30am - 10:30pm<\/p>","map_address":"301 Front St W, Toronto, ON M5V 2T6","api_key":"","show_button":true,"background_image_position":"center center"}},"featured-collection":{"type":"featured-collection","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Featured collection","home_featured_products":"","per_row":4,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"form":{"type":"contact-form","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Contact us","text":"","show_phone":false,"narrow_column":true}},"27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486679650433__27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95-1678251146b4c9656b-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Outdoor Systems"}},"template--14486679650433__27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95-1678251146b4c9656b-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Our most popular and effective outdoor heated flooring systems. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486679650433__27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95-1678251146b4c9656b-0","template--14486679650433__27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95-1678251146b4c9656b-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/driveway-melted-2-min-1_b35fc330-ddfa-4c44-b7d2-257eb0a1f2e6.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"heated driveway","text":"<p>Warmup driveway snow melting products keep driveways snow-free and ice-protected. They are placed under concrete, asphalt or pavers to prevent the accumulation of ice and snow. The system is connected to moisture and temperature sensing control for automated activation.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/heated-driveway"}},"template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_315_41ed67b2-38a3-45f0-8f69-fecb24abeb58.png","image_width":650,"title":"Heated Walkway","text":"<p>Warmup snow melting mats and cables can be installed under pavers, asphalt, or concrete during any typical sidewalk installation. Once installed and wired to an automated control, your heated walkway system will activate automatically.<\/p>","button_label":"learn more","button_link":""}},"template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-2":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image_width":650,"title":"Example title","text":"<p>Use this section to explain a set of product features, to link to a series of pages, or to answer common questions about your products. Add images for emphasis.<\/p>","button_label":"Optional button","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-0","template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-1","template--14486679650433__bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd-1678250364b3e3723b-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_316_97fcb79a-5703-4a41-bcde-00bdf61901b0.png","image_width":650,"title":"Snow Melting Mat","text":"<p>Commonly used in concrete pours, asphalt driveways and paved walkways, Versatile installation in asphalt, concrete or under pavers.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_317_5d2db995-d11a-4084-a6bb-8606941adfa0.png","image_width":650,"title":"snow melting cables","text":"<p>Snow Melting Cables are the loose equivalent of the Mats. The cables are reinforced and can withstand traffic and setting material.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_317_6c4734bc-cecd-476e-8eb7-6c07fa5dd50f.png","image_width":650,"title":"Controls & Accessories","text":"<p>Connect the system to a selection of moisture and temperature sensing controls for automated or controlled activation. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-0","template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-1","template--14486679650433__a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809-1678250364b3e3723b-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}}},"order":["main","slideshow","rich-text","text-columns","map","featured-collection","form","27e61538-6c87-45a9-9149-9352c2ec0a95","bb2ea769-e943-4b6d-b8ad-0f58c4906bcd","a14beca1-cae5-437e-9b34-5fec53db4809"]}